<p><strong>PIVOT DANCEWEAR AMBASSADOR AGREEMENT</strong></p>

<p>Thank you for being part of the Pivot team!</p>

<p>This Ambassador Agreement ("Agreement") is between Pivot Dancewear ("Pivot") and the selected ambassador ("Ambassador"). The purpose of this program is to build an authentic community of dancers who love Pivot Dancewear and share that love through original content and genuine engagement.</p>

<p><strong>1. AMBASSADOR TERM</strong></p>
<p>Ambassador term: _________________ through _________________. Pivot may renew, extend, or end an ambassador's term at its discretion. Ambassador status is not guaranteed beyond the stated term.</p>

<p><strong>2. AMBASSADOR BENEFITS</strong></p>
<p>While active and meeting program requirements, the Ambassador will receive:</p>
<p>• One (1) complimentary Pivot Dancewear set each quarter. Each set has an approximate retail value of $80.<br>
• A personal 10% off Pivot discount code to share with friends, family, followers, and dance community.<br>
• Early access to select new collections, launches, and special opportunities when offered.<br>
• Opportunities to be featured on Pivot Dancewear social media and other marketing channels.<br>
• Potential opportunities for modeling, photography, events, campaigns, and other Pivot projects.<br>
• Access to special ambassador incentives, challenges, gifts, and giveaways throughout the year.</p>

<p><strong>3. MONTHLY CONTENT REQUIREMENTS</strong></p>
<p>To remain an active Pivot Ambassador and qualify for the quarterly complimentary set, Ambassador agrees to create and publish the following each calendar month:</p>
<p>• At least one (1) original Instagram Reel featuring Pivot Dancewear.<br>
• At least one (1) original Instagram Story featuring Pivot Dancewear.<br>
• At least one (1) original Instagram feed post featuring Pivot Dancewear.<br>
• All three pieces of content must be fresh/original and may not be reused or reposted from a previous month.<br>
• Pivot Dancewear must be clearly tagged in each applicable post, Reel, and Story using @pivotdancewear.<br>
• Content should authentically showcase Pivot Dancewear and be appropriate for the Pivot brand, its customers, and a family-friendly dance community.<br>
• Ambassador agrees to make reasonable efforts to respond to or engage with comments and messages related to Pivot content when appropriate.</p>

<p><strong>4. QUALITY & AUTHENTICITY</strong></p>
<p>Pivot values authentic content over simply checking a box. Ambassadors are encouraged to show their personality, dance style, creativity, and genuine love of Pivot. Content should be clear, current, and reasonably consistent with the quality and image of the Pivot brand.</p>

<p><strong>5. ENGAGEMENT & ADDITIONAL OPPORTUNITIES</strong></p>
<p>Pivot may recognize ambassadors who consistently go above and beyond the minimum requirements. Engagement, creativity, consistency, content quality, participation in Pivot campaigns, use of ambassador codes, and positive interaction with the Pivot community may be considered when Pivot offers additional incentives or opportunities.</p>
<p>Additional opportunities may include extra Pivot product, special gifts, paid or gifted campaigns, additional modeling opportunities, event opportunities, early product access, special features, or other incentives. Additional opportunities are not guaranteed and may vary throughout the year. Meeting the minimum monthly requirements keeps an Ambassador in good standing; going above and beyond may create additional opportunities.</p>

<p><strong>6. QUARTERLY SET ELIGIBILITY</strong></p>
<p>Ambassador must remain in good standing and have completed the required monthly content for the applicable quarter to receive the next complimentary Pivot set. If requirements are not met, Pivot may delay, withhold, or modify the quarterly set at its discretion.</p>

<p><strong>7. DISCOUNT CODE</strong></p>
<p>The Ambassador will receive a unique 10% off discount code for sharing. The code is intended for the Ambassador's personal promotion of Pivot and may not be advertised as a permanent sitewide discount. The Ambassador may not represent the code as a larger discount than authorized by Pivot or combine it with promotions unless Pivot specifically permits it. Pivot may change, pause, or deactivate an ambassador code at any time.</p>

<p><strong>8. CONTENT RIGHTS & PERMISSION TO REPOST</strong></p>
<p>Ambassador grants Pivot Dancewear permission to repost, share, feature, crop, resize, and otherwise use Ambassador's submitted or publicly posted Pivot-related content for Pivot's organic social media, website, email marketing, and other brand marketing channels, without additional compensation, unless otherwise agreed in writing. Pivot will make reasonable efforts to credit the Ambassador when reposting social content.</p>

<p><strong>9. DISCLOSURE</strong></p>
<p>When posting about Pivot, Ambassador agrees to clearly disclose the relationship when required by applicable advertising rules. For example, where appropriate, Ambassador may use language such as "#ad," "#PivotAmbassador," "gifted by @pivotdancewear," or another clear disclosure approved by Pivot. The disclosure should be easy for viewers to notice.</p>

<p><strong>10. BRAND REPRESENTATION</strong></p>
<p>Ambassador agrees to represent Pivot in a positive, respectful, and age-appropriate manner. Ambassador will not knowingly post content while representing Pivot that is hateful, discriminatory, sexually explicit, threatening, illegal, or otherwise reasonably likely to harm the Pivot brand or its community.</p>

<p><strong>11. TERMINATION</strong></p>
<p>Either party may end the Ambassador relationship at any time. Pivot may immediately end the relationship if Ambassador fails to meet program requirements, misuses the discount code, provides misleading or inappropriate content, engages in conduct that conflicts with Pivot's brand values, or otherwise violates this Agreement. Upon termination, Ambassador must stop representing themselves as a Pivot Ambassador and discontinue use of the ambassador discount code.</p>

<p><strong>12. MINORS & PARENT/GUARDIAN CONSENT</strong></p>
<p>If Ambassador is under 18 years of age, a parent or legal guardian must review and sign this Agreement. The parent/guardian consents to the minor's participation in the Pivot Ambassador Program and to the content permissions described above.</p>

<p><strong>13. NO GUARANTEE OF COMPENSATION OR FUTURE OPPORTUNITIES</strong></p>
<p>The Ambassador understands that participation does not guarantee paid work, additional free products beyond the benefits specifically stated in this Agreement, sponsorships, modeling opportunities, sales, follower growth, or renewal for another term.</p>

<p><strong>14. AGREEMENT</strong></p>
<p>By signing below, the parties acknowledge that they have read, understood, and agree to the terms of this Ambassador Agreement.</p>

<p><em>PIVOT DANCEWEAR &nbsp;·&nbsp; STYLE. PERFORMANCE. AFFORDABILITY.</em></p>
